These are third-party products, not source dependencies of this project. The
platform's Terraform mirrors the following upstream images into the deployment's
own private Amazon ECR repositories during `terraform apply`, so an operator who
applies this infrastructure is redistributing them into their own account.

Langfuse — langfuse/langfuse and langfuse/langfuse-worker
(https://langfuse.com/)
  License: distributed under its own license terms; the platform mirrors its
  container images into the deployment's private ECR. Langfuse ships both
  open-source and enterprise-tier components, so consult the upstream project
  for the terms that apply to the image version deployed.

ClickHouse — clickhouse/clickhouse-server (https://clickhouse.com/)
  License: distributed under its own license terms; the platform mirrors its
  container images into the deployment's private ECR.

================================================================================
AWS SERVICES
================================================================================

This project provisions and calls the following AWS services:

Application and data plane
- Amazon DynamoDB
- Amazon Elastic Container Service (Amazon ECS) on AWS Fargate
- Amazon Elastic Container Registry (Amazon ECR)
- Amazon Simple Storage Service (Amazon S3)
- Amazon CloudFront, including Lambda@Edge functions on AWS Lambda
- Amazon API Gateway (HTTP APIs)
- Elastic Load Balancing (Application Load Balancer)
- Amazon Virtual Private Cloud (Amazon VPC)
- AWS Cloud Map
- Amazon Route 53
- AWS Certificate Manager
- Application Auto Scaling

Agents, security, and operations
- Amazon Bedrock
- Amazon Bedrock AgentCore
- AWS Agent Registry (the agent-registry service namespace, split out of
  Amazon Bedrock AgentCore)
- AWS Secrets Manager
- AWS Identity and Access Management (IAM)
- AWS Security Token Service (AWS STS)
- AWS CodeBuild
- Amazon CloudWatch (logs, metrics, alarms, dashboards)

Self-hosted observability stack
- Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL (Amazon RDS)
- Amazon ElastiCache
- Amazon Elastic File System (Amazon EFS)

Use of these services is subject to the AWS Customer Agreement
(https://aws.amazon.com/agreement/) and the AWS Service Terms
(https://aws.amazon.com/service-terms/).

